      "en": "Each panel is a pentagon \"flower head\" with a smiling face on a stem, surrounded by 0–4 small suns (☀), sometimes a lightning bolt (⚡) and/or a cloud (☁); small oval \"leaves\" sit around the stem, outline or filled black.\n\n[suns×3, no cloud/bolt, stem: 2 outline leaves]  —  [suns×2, bolt, stem: 0 leaves]  —  [suns×4, no bolt/cloud, stem: 2 filled leaves]  —  [suns×2, bolt, stem: 3 outline leaves]  —  [suns×2, bolt+cloud, stem: 2 filled + 2 outline leaves]  —  ?",
      "es": "Cada panel es una «cabeza de flor» pentagonal con una cara sonriente sobre un tallo, rodeada de 0–4 pequeños soles (☀), a veces un rayo (⚡) y/o una nube (☁); pequeñas «hojas» ovaladas se sitúan alrededor del tallo, en contorno o rellenas de negro.\n\n[soles×3, sin nube/rayo, tallo: 2 hojas en contorno]  —  [soles×2, rayo, tallo: 0 hojas]  —  [soles×4, sin rayo/nube, tallo: 2 hojas rellenas]  —  [soles×2, rayo, tallo: 3 hojas en contorno]  —  [soles×2, rayo+nube, tallo: 2 hojas rellenas + 2 en contorno]  —  ?"
